From 9931721cb9bab61e94e2b5425a97c0fa72aa83a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Til Kaiser <mail@tk154.de>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 19:52:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] wolfguard: add eBPF kfuncs for data plane interaction

Expose eleven kfuncs for XDP and TC device, peer and receiving-keypair
lookups, endpoint tuples, reference release, and in-place AES-GCM crypto.
Preserve the WireGuard API signatures, verifier flags and ownership rules
under the bpf_wolf namespace while using WolfGuard's crypto wrappers.

Share native nonce allocation, replay validation and key-refresh timers.
Add BTF-gated registration with initialization cleanup and a disabled-API
stub for external-module builds. Update the existing replay selftest to
use the exposed validation helper.

Document the modified-kernel requirements and packet/reference contracts.
